# Uncertainty

Follow [docs/product/uncertainty-protocol.md](../../docs/product/uncertainty-protocol.md). Do not restate that protocol here.

```
UNKNOWN + NOT BLOCKING → preserve unknown and continue
UNKNOWN + BLOCKING     → stop and ask
NEVER                  → invent ranch truth
```

A reversible internal technical assumption is acceptable only under the conditions defined in that protocol.

Do not guess business, domain, UX, financial, or security ambiguity.
